1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,620
We are here in a quiet demonstration to demand from our government to do everything they can

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:11,280
to release the Israeli hostages that are held alive right now in Gaza Strip.

3
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,660
We tell our government a very clear message.

4
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,000
Don't talk to us about flattening Gaza, about bringing it back to the Stone Age.

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,460
Don't promise us more death and more casualties and more blood.

6
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,640
We want you to work on the living.

7
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:30,140
We want you to promise us that you will do everything you can to come to a deal to release the hostages.

8
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:35,080
Do everything you can to save the lives of people that are still alive.

9
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:41,220
What you do right now as a government is disappoint us and to abandon us once again.

10
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,780
We are abandoned enough.

11
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,140
We are heartbroken.

12
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:51,740
We need a true and a real responsible power in the leadership to promise us that we can survive this moment.

13
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:55,320
The entire people that live here, please come to a deal.

14
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,160
Release the hostages now.

